      "mergedPostDetails": "I logged in after having just played about an hour before with no problems, and saw that my avatar was for some reason changed to the default robot guy. When I opened the esc menu to change it back I found I could click none of the buttons. I clicked around to make sure it wasn't my click not working or something but it seemed to definitely be the buttons. All my other controls seem to work fine, and I tried going to a different world (had to use one of those portals in the hub bc of course I can get to the worlds tab through the menu) and restarting the game several times but nothing is changing. I would try logging out and logging back in, but I cant get to settings to do that. Can't play like this, so any help would be appreciated.\nEDIT: After 1200 tries I managed to click the cancel button in the 0.2 seconds the game takes to load up and log out that way. Unfortunately, logging out and back in did absolutely nothing. I tried changing into some avatars in the home world to test my click AGAIN and they worked. The menu buttons are just all unclickable, I can have no interaction with them and I have NO idea why because everything was fine earlier today.",
