      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Here's not a log but a video https://twitter.com/ChiuGameProject/status/1137181646233358337\n\nI asked Chiu what happen:\n5sec: After opening menu, blue particle appears.\n6sec: When pointer on \"Avatar\" menu item, white highlight doesn't appear around center pointer, item frame doesn't become bright. Menu item doesn't work. \n10sec: (OMG!)\n17sec: All menu items don't respond.\n19sec: Jump forward and open menu while in the air to get closer to the menu. \n21sec: Then, it responds. (open \"Avatar\" menu and cancel it)\n26sec: Open again, it still doesn't work.\n29sec: Open menu and click other player, then menu contents changed. And cancel it.\n34sec: Open again, this time, the menu works.  (open \"Avatar\" menu)\n\nIt's not uncertain whether it relates the issue, but \n* the client was desktop mode.\n* it happens after changing to generic avatar",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
