      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I could reproduce. I think required conditions are: \n1. Execute VRChat.exe without --no-vr option\n2. VR device is unavailable. (power off)\n3. Lower \"User Real Height\" setting and higher avatar eye level\n\nThere are some ways to execute VRChat.exe without --no-vr in which user might do.\n1. Context menu of Steam in Windows Start menu\n2. Pinned VRChat on Windows Taskbar or Start menu\n3. Double click VRChat.exe in Windows explorer\n4. Shortcut file to VRChat.exe",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
